["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Steve Hilton &amp; Spencer Pratt: Fixing California, Cheaper Gas, Ballot Fraud &amp; CA Republicans ballot harvesting resource curse cap and invest low carbon fuel standard mass tort\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-allin-硅谷太赚钱-反而让加州政府没有变好的动力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/31e8abb9605670fc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>硅谷太赚钱，反而让加州政府没有变好的动力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加州一党独大 16 年，不是因为选民想要大政府，而是硅谷上缴的税收太丰厚，政府不需要靠政绩生存。州长候选人 Steve Hilton 说，代价是贫穷率、失业率和生活成本全美最高。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">加州</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"89.当 AI 进入组织，那些「从没人说过的真相」｜与网易阮良聊 AI 原生组织与企业 Agent 实战 Vibe Coding Agent Skills OPC 鲁棒性\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-lightstar-个人提效三倍-公司交付只从20天缩到17天/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1386f347b8716dd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"卫\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">漫谈Light the Star</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>个人提效三倍，公司交付只从20天缩到17天</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI武装了每个人，组织却没变快——因为木桶的短板不是人，是流程。真正的分水岭是能不能改造流程和组织，而不是给员工发token。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI原生组织</span><span class=\"tag\">企业Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"240. 月饼一年只卖两个月，为什么还能做成282亿的生意？ GB19855 mini package OEM 桃山皮\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-23-beiwanglu-月饼一年只卖两个月-却做成了282亿的生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c56ff7e702000290-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"贝\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">贝望录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>月饼一年只卖两个月，却做成了282亿的生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">月饼被中秋绑定后反而困住了销售期，但282亿的规模靠的是送礼场景和柔性定制产线，不是靠口味创新。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品行业</span><span class=\"tag\">消费</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"🔬 An Oscar, Two Asteroids, and the Algorithm in Your sklearn: John Platt on AI for Science ERA Monte Carlo Tree Search upper confidence bound contrail NISQ broom sensor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-latentspace-ai-做科学卡在最后-0-001-分-不是卡在算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3960561d47aff299-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:01:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>AI 做科学卡在最后 0.001 分，不是卡在算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">ERA 能跑出成千上万个候选 notebook，却关不上最后 30 名的差距——因为内层是机器，外层还得靠人判断「这篇论文你搞错了」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for science</span><span class=\"tag\">气候建模</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Julian Gewirtz on Trump-Xi Summit, AI, and Mao Dead Fifty Years Ago! K-shaped open weight models Memcon peak China\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-chinatalk-特朗普请习近平看戏-美国换到了什么实质东西/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d08a480527461540-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>特朗普请习近平看戏，美国换到了什么实质东西</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这场国事访问几乎没有实质议程，纯粹是象征与镜头。问题不是会不会出岔子，而是美国拿象征换到了什么实质——目前看，什么都没换。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美关系</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside Canada&#x27;s EU Courtship associate member Erasmus NAFTA price discovery\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-wsjournal-加拿大想加入欧盟-这是对美国的永久分手-不是等特朗普下台/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>加拿大想加入欧盟：这是对美国的永久分手，不是等特朗普下台</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加拿大要当欧盟第一个「准成员」，但欧盟根本没有这个身份。这是一次押注欧洲、疏远美国的世代级转向，而欧洲经济增速只有美国的一半。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地缘经济</span><span class=\"tag\">加拿大</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode 341: Psychology Ranked (With Paul Bloom) replication crisis false belief task theory of mind social priming precognition construct\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-verybad-心理学经典实验排等级-很多结论撑不过复现/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de9fabd2316045b0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>心理学经典实验排等级，很多结论撑不过复现</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">米尔格拉姆电击实验还能复现，这本身就够离谱；而好撒玛利亚人实验总共只有 40 个受试者，就算他们对了也是碰巧对的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">复现危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside the &#x27;modern slavery&#x27; where cyber scammers are victims themselves pig butchering Tether Volt Typhoon industrial control systems\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-freshair-杀猪盘里没有赢家-骗人的人也是被贩卖的奴隶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ac302fa97b80aab2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>杀猪盘里没有赢家：骗人的人也是被贩卖的奴隶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">东南亚诈骗园区里，被没收护照、按业绩罚款的「员工」每天用 ChatGPT 和 DeepSeek 写情话，骗走受害者的全部积蓄——这是史上最赚钱的网络犯罪，受害者站在两边。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网络诈骗</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 滥用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Carlo Rovelli: Free Will Is Real. Physics Can Prove It. coarse graining loop quantum gravity relational quantum mechanics Josephson junction equivalence principle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-intotheimpossi-熵增不等于变乱-油水分层-霜花结晶都是自发的秩序/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dfac8bb59ae9df0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>熵增不等于变乱：油水分层、霜花结晶都是自发的秩序</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">热力学第二定律常被讲成「东西会越来越乱」，但油水分离、沙滩分选、窗上霜花都是自发有序。Carlo Rovelli 说，低熵也许不在宇宙，而在我们看宇宙的方式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">量子引力</span><span class=\"tag\">熵与时间</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Blake Scholl: Why Plane Speed Stalled, Supersonic Commercial Flight, &amp; Revolutionizing the Engine boomless cruise Mach cutoff behind the meter return on net assets\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-allin-超音速客机没落五十年-卡在发动机不在空气动力学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27508ce5ab7e7d59-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">17:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>超音速客机没落五十年，卡在发动机不在空气动力学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">协和式被禁不是因为技术不行，是音爆砸到地面；Boom 用大气折射把音爆拐上天，禁令就没了。真正卡住超音速半个世纪的是发动机，而它现在先拿去给数据中心发电。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">超音速</span><span class=\"tag\">航空</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Rebranding in a war zone, with Prosper Global (formerly Mercy Corps) From Hormuz to Hunger Gaza Sky Geeks USAID\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-masterscale-慈善机构改名-为什么比企业改名更危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a46e1455d559a76a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">26:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>慈善机构改名，为什么比企业改名更危险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Mercy Corps 改名 Prosper Global，不是因为战略变了，而是旧名字装不下它已经在做的事——但改名在冲突地区可能让员工更危险。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人道援助</span><span class=\"tag\">品牌重塑</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The connection crisis: Why kids are struggling with friendship and what parents can do with Dr. Niobe Way social health antisocial culture crisis of connection relational intelligence metacognition\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-secureattach-青少年友谊崩溃-不是依恋出了问题-而是文化不奖励关怀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>青少年友谊崩溃，不是依恋出了问题，而是文化不奖励关怀</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">四十年追踪发现，安全依恋只是保护因素：活在把成绩和竞争看得比关怀更重的文化里，再安全的依恋也救不了青春期的连接危机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">青少年友谊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Gabe Stengel - Building Investing Superintelligence - [Invest Like the Best, EP.492] harness MNPI IC memo DDQ CIM compaction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-ilt-ai-时代最值钱的不是智能-是审计轨迹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/43ac9b62bb7e7549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>AI 时代最值钱的不是智能，是审计轨迹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rogo 创始人 Gabe Stengel 说，模型已经比任何他认识的人都聪明，剩下的全是管道工程——谁把管道铺进银行的合规和系统记录里，谁就赢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企业销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rocky Statue deliberate monument unintentional monument Monument Lab slobs versus snobs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-ninepi-洛奇雕像不是艺术品-却成了费城拆不掉的地标/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">32:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>洛奇雕像不是艺术品，却成了费城拆不掉的地标</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一尊为电影造的铜像，被艺术委员会否决、被搬去体育馆、在仓库里躺过，最后靠的不是艺术价值，而是费城人认它——雕像的地位从来是观众给的，不是专家给的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共艺术</span><span class=\"tag\">城市史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Ep 222 Vitamin K: Calling the shots vitamin K deficiency bleeding intramuscular injection kernicterus menaquinones phylloquinone GLA proteins\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-tpwky-维生素-k-注射被拒率翻倍-婴儿脑出血本可避免/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>维生素 K 注射被拒率翻倍，婴儿脑出血本可避免</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所有新生儿出生时都生理性缺乏维生素 K，一针肌肉注射能把晚期出血风险降到接近零；但美国拒打率从 3% 涨到 5.8%，拒打的婴儿晚期出血风险高 81 倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">儿科</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How will the US refill its dwindling oil reserves? Strategic Petroleum Reserve (SPR) royalty-in-kind Strait of Hormuz\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-indicator-美国战略石油储备见底-委内瑞拉石油救不了它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">9:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Indicator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>美国战略石油储备见底，委内瑞拉石油救不了它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">盐穴储备已跌至1982年以来最低，过度取用正在溶解盐层、让洞穴结构失稳；委内瑞拉石油类型不同、还需1000亿美元基础设施投入，绕不开国会拨款这个死结。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源安全</span><span class=\"tag\">石油储备</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Connecting with Kids Shouldn&#x27;t Be a Performance sportscasting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-unruffled-让孩子表演不是连接-是在消耗他/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">22:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>让孩子表演不是连接，是在消耗他</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">连接不是让孩子重复他会的东西来取悦你，而是观察、接收、把他当一个人看待。表演式连接是快餐，吃完就没了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">亲子连接</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Beat the Pentagon’s Bureaucracy? CJADC2 NPIC time and materials token economics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-22-chinatalk-五角大楼不缺模型-缺的是把情报送到总统桌上的那条链/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4924f7885153b4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">49:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0922</span></div>\n<h2>五角大楼不缺模型，缺的是把情报送到总统桌上的那条链</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">U-2 侦察机真正的奇迹不是飞机，是采购改革、情报分析机构和把判断送到总统面前的那条链。今天 AI 已远超政府整合能力，光有 API 不够。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">国防 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">采购改革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why we procrastinate, and what actually helps (with Itamar Shatz) self-control fallacy decatastrophize zigzagger temporal motivation theory temptation bundling\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-clearerthink-拖延不是意志力问题-下次你还会用同一个计划失败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d6c2f45dd923b89a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">56:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Clearer Thinking</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>拖延不是意志力问题：下次你还会用同一个计划失败</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">拖延是明知有害却仍推迟，约两成成年人长期如此。焦虑、分心、倦怠、完美主义各有不同解法，但共同前提是：不换计划，结果不会变。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">拖延</span><span class=\"tag\">行为科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jev: System One models for Prod, not God — with Diogo Almeida, CEO, TypeSafe AI mode dropping RLCD RLVR Noulli intelligence per dollar\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-latentspace-rlhf-的代价是-mode-dropping-不是对齐/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d147c8ceaf2daa17-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">2:20:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>RLHF 的代价是 mode dropping，不是对齐</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RLHF 为了不出错逼模型极度保守，把字符串概率分布整体毒化；TypeSafe 的 Jev 走另一条路，只优化 intelligence per dollar。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型训练</span><span class=\"tag\">RLHF</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Naveen Rao: 4D Computing, AI&#x27;s Energy Wall &amp; Beating Biology dynamical systems theory von Neumann architecture sparsity Jevons paradox 4D computing state space trajectory\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-allin-ai-三年内会撞上能源墙-解法是造一台不像计算机的计算机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77b757da5faf27af-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">22:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>AI 三年内会撞上能源墙，解法是造一台不像计算机的计算机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Google 一家公司每月消耗 3.2 千万亿 token，按每 token 10 焦耳算就是 12 吉瓦，而全美数据中心总功率约 40 吉瓦。Naveen Rao 认为这个缺口只能靠换掉计算机的底层范式来填。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片架构</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The World is Running Out of Fuel strategic petroleum reserves tank bottoms dark fleet resin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-wsjournal-战略储备快见底-油价危机才真正开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">20:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>战略储备快见底，油价危机才真正开始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去半年油价没失控，靠的是战略储备、被制裁石油和中国少买这三块缓冲垫；现在三块都在被抽干，真正的冲击才要传导到柴油和物价上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源</span><span class=\"tag\">油价</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Safety Language Is Destroying the Debate | Steven Sinofsky alignment telemetry CVE OPSEC SevOne, PriOne\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-a16z-ai-安全语言正在毁掉监管讨论-那是-bug-不是恶魔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">29:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全语言正在毁掉监管讨论：那是 bug，不是恶魔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 出错说成「未对齐」，等于给软件加上意图和道德判断，让国会和公众无法理解到底发生了什么——它本该被当作 bug 来调试、上报和修复。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">软件工程</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"How to Make a Difference: Part 1 learned helplessness explanatory style learned optimism agency axial age\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-21-hiddenbrain-乐观不是性格-是一套可以练的解释风格/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda02344d4b647e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">48:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Brain</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0921</span></div>\n<h2>乐观不是性格，是一套可以练的解释风格</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">无助是学来的，乐观也是。决定人是否放弃的不是打击本身，而是他把打击解释成永久、普遍、还是自己的错。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">习得性无助</span>\n</div></div></a>"]